# CAR, CRVAL2 = 30, LONPOLE = 60.0000000016: celset's slz = sin(lat0) /
# |cos(phip - phi0)| = 1 + 5e-11, above 1 by less than its 1e-10
# tolerance, so wcslib clamps it to 1 (cel.c) instead of refusing the
# header. Twin of hdrcases_reject/celpole_slz_tol_out. Synthetic.
NOTE pipeline: celset slz = 1 + 5e-11 clamped to 1
GRID 1 512 9 1 512 9
SKYGRID 0 350 8 -80 80 5
HEADER
NAXIS   = 2
NAXIS1  = 512
NAXIS2  = 512
CTYPE1  = 'RA---CAR'
CTYPE2  = 'DEC--CAR'
CRVAL1  = 10.0
CRVAL2  = 30.0
CRPIX1  = 256.5
CRPIX2  = 256.5
CDELT1  = -0.1
CDELT2  = 0.1
LONPOLE = 60.0000000016
